@startuml cu46
!theme plain
title CU46 — Consultar pago

actor "Receptionist (Recepcionista)" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The receptionist (Recepcionista) or notary (Escribano) decides to look up payments.
System -> System : Receptionist
Actor -> Actor : Requests: (Budget number; First and last name; Identification type and number)
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The receptionist (Recepcionista) or notary (Escribano) enters the data.
System -> System : Receptionist
Actor -> Actor : Presents the list of budgets.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The receptionist (Recepcionista) or notary (Escribano) selects a budget.
System -> System : Receptionist
Actor -> Actor : Presents: (Management number; Budget number; Total; Balance; Payment number; Amount; Date; Notes)
System -> System : System

@enduml